# Baxter Stockman: "When Baxter Stockman enters, create a 1/1 colorless Robot artifact creature token. At the beginning of combat on your turn, target artifact creature you
# control gets +3/+0 and gains first strike and vigilance until end of turn." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Memnite, Ornithopter and Baxter (Black Lotus for {U}{U}{U}, Mox Ruby, Mox
